{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get to Ganymede</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/e6d50d7853e4ce89ed9fa1e7e117d4c6.poster.avif?t=1774601846\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/e6d50d7853e4ce89ed9fa1e7e117d4c6.webm?t=1774601846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/e6d50d7853e4ce89ed9fa1e7e117d4c6.mp4?t=1774601846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Contact Protocol</i> is a <strong>starship job simulator</strong> taking place in a gritty, cassette-future. Humanity has spread throughout the solar system and started extracting its natural resources.   <br><br>You play as the security officer aboard PALE HORSE - a Galileo Corporation vessel carrying miners set for <strong>Ganymede</strong>, Jupiter's biggest moon. It\u2019s your job to  assess the intentions of approaching ships, decide their fate, and keep your crew alive. <strong>The company is watching.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do your Paperwork</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/9e6803ec2b57b9552e21253b6a09451e.poster.avif?t=1774601846\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/9e6803ec2b57b9552e21253b6a09451e.webm?t=1774601846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/9e6803ec2b57b9552e21253b6a09451e.mp4?t=1774601846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your new role will require you to...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate</strong>: Cross-reference incoming data bursts against company records</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interrogate</strong>: Prod for answers to explain discrepancies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage</strong>: Destroy incoming ships with inconsistent data or suspicious communications</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-task</strong>: Fix contact frequencies, check hull images, and recover corrupted data - all while answering comms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet shipmates</strong>: Talk to the crew in an effort to stay sane in the depths of space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Document</strong>: Mismanaged paperwork can expose your employer to\u00a0<strong>legal action.\u00a0</strong>We wouldn't want that, would we?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time is of the Essence</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/439e4d422b2a27f88dcc0d106e760c13.poster.avif?t=1774601846\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/439e4d422b2a27f88dcc0d106e760c13.webm?t=1774601846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/439e4d422b2a27f88dcc0d106e760c13.mp4?t=1774601846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As ships approach, you'll have limited time to uncover their intentions and act. <i>Contact Protocol</i> will test your multi-tasking skills, but also your instincts; thinking takes time that you don't have. What decisions will you make?<br><br>You are not always in control, but you are always\u00a0<strong>accountable</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/77772f5742bc1f0a5266a649f023ead4.poster.avif?t=1774601846\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/77772f5742bc1f0a5266a649f023ead4.webm?t=1774601846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/77772f5742bc1f0a5266a649f023ead4.mp4?t=1774601846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural ships</strong>: Every encounter will be different</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices matter</strong>: Your decisions will affect your relationships with the crew, and their narratives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong>: Your choices will have knock-on effects throughout the solar system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom moral profile</strong>: Get a shareable breakdown of your actions when you finish the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customisable workspace</strong>: Don't enjoy the colour of your console text? Change it! Don't like how that bobblehead is looking at you? Chuck it out the airlock!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846690?t=1774601846","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846690?t=1774601846","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/2407aa36332aa35c2fedf6ecf10298398bddd241/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774601846","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/2407aa36332aa35c2fedf6ecf10298398bddd241/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774601846","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Our game takes place in a dark, late-stage capitalistic future where the value on human life has shrunk in response to corporate needs/power.\r\n\r\nDepending on the encounter, you'll find ships that use profanity. One of our planned NPCs will be depicted smoking in all his appearances. Cigarettes may also appear on the player's work station.\r\n\r\nThe only violence present in our game is the torpedo ship combat that can result in the deaths of all crewmembers on board either ship during an encounter.\r\n\r\nThe full game may include themes of mental health issues and suicide."},"demos":[{"appid":4460330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get to Ganymede</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/e6d50d7853e4ce89ed9fa1e7e117d4c6.poster.avif?t=1774601846\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/e6d50d7853e4ce89ed9fa1e7e117d4c6.webm?t=1774601846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/e6d50d7853e4ce89ed9fa1e7e117d4c6.mp4?t=1774601846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Contact Protocol</i> is a <strong>starship job simulator</strong> taking place in a gritty, cassette-future. Humanity has spread throughout the solar system and started extracting its natural resources.   <br><br>You play as the security officer aboard PALE HORSE - a Galileo Corporation vessel carrying miners set for <strong>Ganymede</strong>, Jupiter's biggest moon. It\u2019s your job to  assess the intentions of approaching ships, decide their fate, and keep your crew alive. <strong>The company is watching.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do your Paperwork</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/9e6803ec2b57b9552e21253b6a09451e.poster.avif?t=1774601846\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/9e6803ec2b57b9552e21253b6a09451e.webm?t=1774601846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/9e6803ec2b57b9552e21253b6a09451e.mp4?t=1774601846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your new role will require you to...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate</strong>: Cross-reference incoming data bursts against company records</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interrogate</strong>: Prod for answers to explain discrepancies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage</strong>: Destroy incoming ships with inconsistent data or suspicious communications</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-task</strong>: Fix contact frequencies, check hull images, and recover corrupted data - all while answering comms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet shipmates</strong>: Talk to the crew in an effort to stay sane in the depths of space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Document</strong>: Mismanaged paperwork can expose your employer to\u00a0<strong>legal action.\u00a0</strong>We wouldn't want that, would we?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time is of the Essence</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/439e4d422b2a27f88dcc0d106e760c13.poster.avif?t=1774601846\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/439e4d422b2a27f88dcc0d106e760c13.webm?t=1774601846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/439e4d422b2a27f88dcc0d106e760c13.mp4?t=1774601846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As ships approach, you'll have limited time to uncover their intentions and act. <i>Contact Protocol</i> will test your multi-tasking skills, but also your instincts; thinking takes time that you don't have. What decisions will you make?<br><br>You are not always in control, but you are always\u00a0<strong>accountable</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/77772f5742bc1f0a5266a649f023ead4.poster.avif?t=1774601846\" width=780 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/77772f5742bc1f0a5266a649f023ead4.webm?t=1774601846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846690/extras/77772f5742bc1f0a5266a649f023ead4.mp4?t=1774601846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural ships</strong>: Every encounter will be different</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragr